1-22-26:
Send my fearFor the fulfillment of this promise see Num. 22:3; Joshua 2:9, 11;
9:24. The enemies of the Israelites did turn their backs in defeat (Num. 21:3, 24, 35;
Joshua 8:20–24; 10:10, 11). Had Israel gone on to full obedience God would have
thoroughly broken the power of the Canaanite nations.
